#. type: Title =
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to run the Fedora Annual Contributor Survey"
msgstr "Så genomför du Fedoras årliga enkät för bidragsgivare"

#. type: Title ==
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Survey Schedule"
msgstr "Enkätschema"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Apr 1st**:\n"
"Open {team_issue_tracker}[{team_name} ticket] to track progress and collect feedback\n"
msgstr ""
"**1 april**:\n"
"Öppna {team_issue_tracker}[ett {team_name}-ärende] för att följa framstegen och samla in återkoppling\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Apr 1st**:\n"
"Open {url_badges_issues}[Badges ticket] to request badge design & publication\n"
msgstr ""
"**1 april**:\n"
"Öppna {url_badges_issues}[ett Badges-ärende] för att begära utformning och publicering av ett märke\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**April 1st**:\n"
"Open {url_design_issues}[Design ticket] to request banner design\n"
msgstr ""
"**1 april**:\n"
"Öppna {url_design_issues}[ett Design-ärende] för att begära utformning av en banderoll\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**May 1st**:\n"
"Open https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/websites/[Websites and Apps Team ticket] to request banner published on Fedora sites\n"
msgstr ""
"**1 maj**:\n"
"Öppna https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/websites/[ett ärende för Websites and Apps Team] för att begära att banderollen publiceras på Fedora-sajter\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**May 15-24th**:\n"
"Update LimeSurvey data according to the changes in the Survey Questions accumulated over the last year.\n"
msgstr ""
"**15–24 maj**:\n"
"Uppdatera LimeSurvey-data enligt de ändringar i enkätfrågorna som har samlats under det senaste året.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**May 24-31st**:\n"
"Review of actual survey in LimeSurvey. Approval from xref:fca.adoc[FCA] is necessary at this step.\n"
msgstr ""
"**24–31 maj**:\n"
"Granska den faktiska enkäten i LimeSurvey. Godkännande från xref:fca.adoc[FCA] krävs i detta steg.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**June 1st**:\n"
"Publish link:{url_commblog}[Community Blog] Post promoting survey\n"
msgstr ""
"**1 juni**:\n"
"Publicera ett link:{url_commblog}[inlägg i Community Blog] som marknadsför enkäten\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**June 1st-30th**:\n"
"Survey runs\n"
msgstr ""
"**1–30 juni**:\n"
"Enkäten är öppen\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**June 1st**:\n"
"Announce survey is open for month of June on IRC and Twitter\n"
msgstr ""
"**1 juni**:\n"
"Meddela på IRC och Twitter att enkäten är öppen under juni\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**June 15th**:\n"
"Two week reminder to fill out survey on IRC and Twitter\n"
msgstr ""
"**15 juni**:\n"
"Påminnelse efter två veckor om att fylla i enkäten på IRC och Twitter\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**June 30th**:\n"
"One day reminder to fill out survey on IRC and Twitter\n"
msgstr ""
"**30 juni**:\n"
"Påminnelse dagen före sista dagen om att fylla i enkäten på IRC och Twitter\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**July 1st-31st**:\n"
"First round of survey analysis\n"
msgstr ""
"**1–31 juli**:\n"
"Första analysomgången av enkäten\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**First weekend in August**:\n"
"Flock to Fedora/Nest with Fedora presentation\n"
msgstr ""
"**Första helgen i augusti**:\n"
"Flock to Fedora/Nest med en Fedora-presentation\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**By end of August**:\n"
"Publish link:{url_commblog}/writing-community-blog-article/[Community Blog].\n"
"Post with results, analysis, and overview of presence at Flock/Nest.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Före slutet av augusti**:\n"
"Publicera i link:{url_commblog}/writing-community-blog-article/[Community Blog].\n"
"Lägg upp resultat, analys och en översikt över närvaron vid Flock/Nest.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Promotion"
msgstr "Marknadsföring"

#. type: Title ===
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fedora Badges"
msgstr "Fedora Badges"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Each year we generate a https://badges.fedoraproject.org/[Fedora Badge] that"
" survey recipients can claim when they submit their survey responses.  A "
"ticket needs to be opened on the {url_badges_issues}[Badges repo] requesting"
" the badge.  The panda graphic stays the same, and the year is updated "
"accordingly.  *This ticket should be opened by April 1st* in order to give "
"the Badges team enough time to generate the artwork, push the badge to the "
"website, and provide a claim link to the Survey team."
msgstr ""
"Varje år skapar vi ett https://badges.fedoraproject.org/[Fedora-märke] som "
"enkätmottagare kan hämta när de har skickat in sina svar. Ett ärende måste "
"öppnas i {url_badges_issues}[Badges-förrådet] för att begära märket. "
"Pandagrafiken förblir densamma och året uppdateras därefter. *Ärendet bör "
"öppnas senast 1 april* så att Badges-teamet hinner skapa grafiken, lägga upp"
" märket på webbplatsen och ge enkätteamet en hämtningslänk."

#. type: Title ====
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Past Badges"
msgstr "Tidigare märken"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:53
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:65
msgid "2021"
msgstr "2021"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:54
msgid "https://badges.fedoraproject.org/badge/community-survey-taker-i[Badge]"
msgstr ""
"https://badges.fedoraproject.org/badge/community-survey-taker-i[Märke]"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:55
msgid "https://forge.fedoraproject.org/apps/badges-assets/issues/800[Ticket]"
msgstr "https://forge.fedoraproject.org/apps/badges-assets/issues/800[Ärende]"

#. type: Title ===
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Community Blog Post"
msgstr "Inlägg i Community Blog"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Each year we need to write at least two blog posts for the survey.  The "
"first one is to promote taking the survey, the second features the released "
"dataset and any findings.  These are published on the "
"link:{url_commblog}[CommBlog], make sure to follow "
"link:{url_commblog}/writing-community-blog-article/[the guidelines].  The "
"promotional blog post should then be pinned on Discussion.fpo for the month "
"the survey is open."
msgstr ""
"Varje år behöver vi skriva minst två blogginlägg om enkäten. Det första ska "
"uppmuntra till deltagande, det andra beskriver den publicerade "
"datauppsättningen och eventuella resultat. De publiceras i "
"link:{url_commblog}[CommBlog]; följ link:{url_commblog}/writing-community-"
"blog-article/[riktlinjerna]. Marknadsföringsinlägget bör sedan fästas i "
"Discussion.fpo under den månad då enkäten är öppen."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:66
msgid ""
"link:{url_commblog}/help-make-fedora-awesome-by-taking-the-first-annual-"
"contributor-survey/[Survey Promotion]"
msgstr ""
"link:{url_commblog}/help-make-fedora-awesome-by-taking-the-first-annual-"
"contributor-survey/[Marknadsföring av enkäten]"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:67
msgid ""
"link:{url_commblog}/fedora-contributor-annual-survey-data-set-"
"available/[Dataset]"
msgstr ""
"link:{url_commblog}/fedora-contributor-annual-survey-data-set-"
"available/[Datauppsättning]"

#. type: Title ===
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fedora Websites Banner"
msgstr "Banderoll på Fedora-webbplatser"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:73
msgid ""
"To help ensure we reach the maximum number of Fedora contributors, we "
"promote the survey across as many Fedora spaces as possible including our "
"websites.  This work is done with the assistance of the "
"link:{url_wiki}/Design[Design Team] and the "
"xref:websites::index.adoc[Websites & Apps Team]."
msgstr ""
"För att säkerställa att vi når så många Fedora-bidragsgivare som möjligt "
"marknadsför vi enkäten i så många Fedora-miljöer som möjligt, inklusive på "
"våra webbplatser. Arbetet görs med hjälp av link:{url_wiki}/Design[Design "
"Team] och xref:websites::index.adoc[Websites & Apps Team]."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:80
msgid ""
"The first step is to open a ticket on the {url_design_issues}[Design Team "
"issue tracker] to get any updates on artwork.  *This ticket should be opened"
" by April 1st, and closed by May 1st.* If there are no changes from the "
"Design Team, proceed with the previous design.  Once the artwork is "
"finalized, a ticket is opened on the https://gitlab.com/fedora/websites-"
"apps/fedora-websites/fedora-websites-3.0/-/work_items[Websites & Apps Team] "
"repo to get it published.  *This ticket should be opened by May 1st* and "
"needs continuous check-ins.  The websites that we aim to cover are:"
msgstr ""
"Första steget är att öppna ett ärende i {url_design_issues}[Design Teams "
"ärendehanterare] för att få eventuella uppdateringar av grafiken. *Ärendet "
"bör öppnas senast 1 april och stängas senast 1 maj.* Om Design Team inte gör"
" några ändringar fortsätter du med föregående utformning. När grafiken är "
"klar öppnas ett ärende i förrådet för https://gitlab.com/fedora/websites-"
"apps/fedora-websites/fedora-websites-3.0/-/work_items[Websites & Apps Team] "
"för publicering. *Ärendet bör öppnas senast 1 maj* och följas upp "
"fortlöpande. De webbplatser vi vill täcka är:"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:82
msgid ""
"https://lists.fedorahosted.org/archives/list/hyperkitty-"
"devel@lists.fedorahosted.org/[Hyperkitty]"
msgstr ""
"https://lists.fedorahosted.org/archives/list/hyperkitty-"
"devel@lists.fedorahosted.org/[Hyperkitty]"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:83
msgid "https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/docs/[Docs.fpo]"
msgstr "https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/docs/[Docs.fpo]"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:84
msgid "https://accounts.fedoraproject.org/[Accounts.fpo]"
msgstr "https://accounts.fedoraproject.org/[Accounts.fpo]"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:85
msgid "link:{url_wiki}/Fedora_Project_Wiki[Fedora Wiki]"
msgstr "link:{url_wiki}/Fedora_Project_Wiki[Fedora Wiki]"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:86
msgid "https://start.fedoraproject.org/[Start.fpo]"
msgstr "https://start.fedoraproject.org/[Start.fpo]"

#. type: Title ===
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mailing Lists"
msgstr "E-postlistor"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:92
msgid ""
"A lot of folks are on multiple mailing lists so it is important to choose "
"high level \"announce\" channels over team channels.  A short email should "
"be sent with a link to the Community Blog post as well as a link directly to"
" the survey."
msgstr ""
"Många personer prenumererar på flera sändlistor, så det är viktigt att välja"
" övergripande ”announce”-kanaler framför teamkanaler. Skicka ett kort "
"e-postmeddelande med en länk till inlägget i Community Blog och en "
"direktlänk till enkäten."

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:94
msgid ""
"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/admin/lists/mindshare@lists.fedoraproject.org/[Mindshare]"
msgstr ""
"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/admin/lists/mindshare@lists.fedoraproject.org/[Mindshare]"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:95
msgid ""
"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/admin/lists/devel-"
"announce.lists.fedoraproject.org/[Devel-announce]"
msgstr ""
"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/admin/lists/devel-"
"announce.lists.fedoraproject.org/[Devel-announce]"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:96
msgid ""
"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/admin/lists/diversity.lists.fedoraproject.org/[DEI]"
msgstr ""
"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/admin/lists/diversity.lists.fedoraproject.org/[DEI]"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:98
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "IRC & Twitter"
msgstr "IRC och Twitter"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:104
msgid ""
"For increased visibility we also promote the survey on IRC and Twitter.  "
"This should be done sparingly as their is a potential for it to feel spammy."
"  It could potentially go to other social media platforms but the main "
"audience for that platform should be contributors not users.  Don't forget "
"to remind people they can earn a badge!"
msgstr ""
"För att öka synligheten marknadsför vi också enkäten på IRC och Twitter. Gör"
" detta sparsamt eftersom det kan uppfattas som spam. Den kan även "
"marknadsföras på andra sociala medieplattformar, men den huvudsakliga "
"målgruppen för den plattformen bör vara bidragsgivare och inte användare. "
"Glöm inte att påminna personer om att de kan få ett märke!"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:107
msgid "(June 1st) Announce survey is open for month of June"
msgstr "(1 juni) Meddela att enkäten är öppen under juni"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:108
msgid "(June 15th) Two week reminder to fill out survey"
msgstr "(15 juni) Påminnelse efter två veckor om att fylla i enkäten"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:109
msgid "(June 30th) One day reminder to fill out survey"
msgstr "(30 juni) Påminnelse dagen före sista dagen om att fylla i enkäten"

#. type: Title ==
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "Storage and process to make changes"
msgstr "Lagring och process för ändringar"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:114
msgid "Take markdown file in {team_name} repo"
msgstr "Ta Markdown-filen i {team_name}-förrådet"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:115
msgid "PR's reviewed and accepted to markdown file through out the year"
msgstr ""
"Sammanslagningsbegäranden till Markdown-filen granskas och godkänns under "
"året"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:116
msgid ""
"git diff to locate the differences and make changes directly in the "
"LimeSurvey UI two weeks prior to running survey"
msgstr ""
"Använd git diff för att hitta skillnaderna och gör ändringarna direkt i "
"LimeSurveys gränssnitt två veckor före enkäten"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:117
msgid "Take the lss-file of the previous survey"
msgstr "Ta LSS-filen från föregående enkät"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:118
msgid "Upload lss-file to LimeSurvey under you personal account"
msgstr "Ladda upp LSS-filen till LimeSurvey under ditt personliga konto"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:119
msgid ""
"Add all changes from the Markdown file as accumulated over the year using "
"Lime Survey interface"
msgstr ""
"Lägg till alla ändringar från Markdown-filen som har samlats under året med "
"LimeSurvey-gränssnittet"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:120
msgid "Export lss-file and submit it as an update to this repository"
msgstr ""
"Exportera LSS-filen och lämna in den som en uppdatering till detta förråd"

#. type: Plain text
#: pages/procedures/survey/how-to.adoc:120
msgid ""
"Share the update lss-file with LimeSurvey Wrangler so that new Survey is "
"created under Fedora account."
msgstr ""
"Dela den uppdaterade LSS-filen med LimeSurvey Wrangler så att den nya "
"enkäten skapas under Fedora-kontot."
